:''This base has no official name.''
The '''Corrupted Cat Base''' (黒ネコの城 ''Kuro Neko no Shiro'', '''Black Cat's Castle''') is an animated [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in [[Day of the Cat]] and [[Horde of Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Corrupted Cat Base
|image = E 312.png
|appearance = [[Day of the Cat]]<br>
[[Horde of Cats]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
Similar to other [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]], this base is immune to most effects. Additionally, the Corrupted Cat Base can fire off a level 20 [[Wave Attack]] if a cat steps in its range, which combined with its typically high magnifications can wipe the field clear of any unit not immune to waves due to its extreme coverage.

Notably, just like the [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]], the Corrupted Cat Base itself is single target, and also features less range. This means fighting outside of its range remains an option in addition to wave blockers.

==Strategy==
Trying to stall the [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] and [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cats]] outside of the Corrupted Cat Base's range to avoid the Wave Attacks is the best idea. To avoid the Waves you can also bring Wave Blockers Like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]].

